        { "text", text = "Sunscorched Shells" },
        { "text", text = "The shells lie on the ground under the wyvern nests at Highperch in western Thousand Needles, deeper into the gorge. Only nine exist and each returns 3 minutes after you pick it, so you will wait; some shell-like things there cannot be looted. Highperch Wyverns (level 28-31) guard them and sometimes come several at once." },
