        { "text", text = "Klockmort Spannerspan" },
        { "text", text = "Ride the Deeprun Tram from Stormwind to Ironforge. Klockmort Spannerspan, a gnome smith, works in |cOXP_PICK_Tinker Town|r near the engineering trainers. He wants 20 |cOXP_LOOT_Searing Coral|r." },
