      { only = "Paladin", source = "polestar:forever/class/paladin/cloak-of-the-divine-storm",
        { "text", text = "Class quest: {item:277205}" },
        { "text", text = "The Strange Orb" },
        { "text", text = "Climb to the top of the Tower of Althalaxx in northern Darkshore. The Dark Strand Fanatics around it are easy (level 16-17), but four Dark Strand Voidcallers (level 28-29) stand in the tower on the way to the orb: each calls a voidwalker and casts Shadow Bolt from range. At 22-25 bring a friend or two, pull them one at a time and step behind a wall so they have to come to you. Loot the Strange Orb at the top: it gives you the Althalaxx Orb; right-click it to start the quest. Keep the orb in your bags until the |cOXP_PICK_Spear of Mannoroth|r: three later quests need it." },
