      },
      { only = "Rogue", source = "polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt",
        { "text", text = "Class quest: {npc:13936}" },
        { "text", text = "The |cOXP_LOOT_Elegant Letter|r" },
        { "text", text = "At 24 any capital's rogue trainer (|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Master Mathias Shaw|r or |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Osborne the Night Man|r in Stormwind, Gest or Ormok in Orgrimmar, and the others) has an |cOXP_LOOT_Elegant Letter|r from |cOXP_ENEMY_Ravenholdt|r for you: ask for it in their talk window. Open it: the quest gives you the |cOXP_LOOT_Seal of Ravenholdt|r for |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Fahrad|r. Learn Detect Traps from your trainer first if you have not; the way in is a test of it." },
        { "xp", level = 24, text = "Reach level 24" },
        { "accept", quest = 6681, text = "Accept The Manor, Ravenholdt" },
        { "item", item = 17126, text = "Starts from |cOXP_LOOT_Elegant Letter|r" },
      },
      { only = "Rogue", source = "polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt",
        { "text", text = "Ravenholdt Manor" },
        { "text", text = "Horde fly to Tarren Mill, Alliance to Southshore. The trail to the manor is hard to see: it starts behind the plateau north of Durnholde Keep, east of Tarren Mill, climbs into the hills and bends twice to a small tunnel. A chest sits in the tunnel: do not open it. Cast Detect Traps near it and walk up close; that is the Rite of Cunning (it comes back after 5 minutes). Opening the chest calls Milton, an elite rogue of about level 32. Through the tunnel lies Ravenholdt Manor: |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Fahrad|r is upstairs inside. Do not attack anyone at the manor: it costs |cOXP_ENEMY_Ravenholdt|r reputation." },
        { "goto", x = 78.64, y = 17.84, zone = "1424" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 6681, text = "Kill Ravenholdt: 1 (Rite of Cunning: Detect Traps beside the tunnel chest)" },
        { "mob", name = "Ravenholdt" },
        { "goto", x = 84.45, y = 80.32, zone = "1416" },
        { "turnin", quest = 6681, text = "Turn in The Manor, Ravenholdt" },
        { "target", name = "Fahrad" },
        { "goto", x = 84.93, y = 80.38, zone = "1416" },
        { "accept", quest = 96779, text = "Accept Syndicate Sabotage" },
        { "target", name = "Myrokos Silentform" },
      },
      { only = "Rogue", source = "polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt",
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_ENEMY_Lord Tomas|r" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_ENEMY_Lord Tomas|r is inside Durnholde Keep, the Syndicate fortress south of the manor; he can stand in any of fifteen spots in the keep, so search. Quick and quiet, says |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Myrokos Silentform|r. Pick the pockets of the level 20-21 Syndicate Rogues, Shadow Mages and Watchmen on your way: they carry Syndicate Emblems for the guards' repeatable reputation quest." },
        { "goto", x = 79.35, y = 46.02, zone = "1424" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 96779, text = "Kill Lord Tomas: 1" },
        { "mob", name = "Lord Tomas" },
        { "goto", x = 79.28, y = 46.37, zone = "1424" },
        { "item", count = 1, item = 17124, text = "Syndicate Emblem: 1" },
      },
      { only = "Rogue", source = "polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt",
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Myrokos Silentform|r" },
        { "goto", x = 84.93, y = 80.38, zone = "1416" },
        { "turnin", quest = 96779, text = "Turn in Syndicate Sabotage" },
        { "target", name = "Myrokos Silentform" },
        { "goto", x = 85.27, y = 79.56, zone = "1416" },
        { "turnin", optional = true, quest = 6701, text = "Turn in Syndicate Emblems (|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Ravenholdt Guard|r: one emblem each time, 100 reputation)" },
        { "target", name = "Ravenholdt Guard" },
      },
      { only = "Rogue", source = "polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt",
        { "text", text = "What's the Big Idea?" },
        { "text", text = "In your mid 30s |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Myrokos Silentform|r has two more jobs; take both. Barton leads a Syndicate scouting party at Strahnbrad, in the east of the Alterac Mountains, inside one of the houses with stealthed Syndicate around him. Pick his pocket for the report and do not kill him: he does not drop it. If you are lower than him he sees through stealth; Master of Deception helps, or Distract him, Vanish and come in from behind. Pick Pocket can miss several times in a row." },
        { "xp", level = 34, text = "Reach level 34" },
        { "goto", x = 84.93, y = 80.38, zone = "1416" },
        { "accept", quest = 96781, text = "Accept What's the Big Idea?" },
        { "target", name = "Myrokos Silentform" },
        { "goto", x = 84.93, y = 80.38, zone = "1416" },
        { "accept", quest = 96783, text = "Accept A Way In" },
        { "target", name = "Myrokos Silentform" },
        { "goto", x = 62.6, y = 46.9, zone = "1416" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 96781, text = "Barton's Scouting Report: 1" },
      },
      { only = "Rogue", source = "polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt",
        { "text", text = "Covert Extraction" },
        { "text", text = "Back to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Myrokos Silentform|r; the report sends you after the Perenolde heirlooms. Two towers stand among the Ruins of Alterac, in the middle of the Alterac Mountains, held by ogres: the shield lies in the northern tower, the sword in the southern one, which elite ogres ring and watch from far off. Stay stealthed; nothing guards the heirlooms inside." },
        { "goto", x = 84.93, y = 80.38, zone = "1416" },
        { "turnin", quest = 96781, text = "Turn in What's the Big Idea?" },
        { "target", name = "Myrokos Silentform" },
        { "goto", x = 84.93, y = 80.38, zone = "1416" },
        { "accept", quest = 96782, text = "Accept Covert Extraction" },
        { "target", name = "Myrokos Silentform" },
        { "goto", x = 41.35, y = 40.16, zone = "1416" },
        { "complete", obj = 2, quest = 96782, text = "Royal Aegis of Perenolde: 1 (|cOXP_LOOT_Royal Aegis of Perenolde|r, in the northern tower)" },
        { "goto", x = 38.5, y = 58, zone = "1416" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 96782, text = "Blade of House Perenolde: 1 (|cOXP_LOOT_Blade of House Perenolde|r, in the southern tower)" },
        { "goto", x = 84.93, y = 80.38, zone = "1416" },
        { "turnin", quest = 96782, text = "Turn in Covert Extraction" },
        { "target", name = "Myrokos Silentform" },
      },
      { only = "Rogue", source = "polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt",
        { "text", text = "A Way In" },
        { "text", text = "Stromgarde Keep in western Arathi is a Syndicate stronghold; to get in you need a uniform. Northfold Manor, in north-western Arathi, is held by Syndicate Highwaymen, Pathstalkers and Mercenaries (level 30-32): find the |cOXP_PICK_Syndicate Footlocker|r there and take the uniform; that ends A Way In." },
        { "goto", x = 32.3, y = 26.6, zone = "1417" },
        { "turnin", quest = 96783, text = "Turn in A Way In (|cOXP_PICK_Syndicate Footlocker|r, Northfold Manor)" },
        { "goto", x = 32.3, y = 26.6, zone = "1417" },
        { "accept", quest = 96784, text = "Accept Master of Disguise (Master of Disguise: the |cOXP_LOOT_Syndicate Uniform|r)" },
      },
      { only = "Rogue", source = "polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt",
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Anastasia Miller|r" },
        { "text", text = "Stromgarde's Syndicate Prowlers and Conjurors are elite (level 35-36): a rogue of 36 can slip past them, but fighting one alone is hard, so stay hidden or bring a friend. Put on the |cOXP_LOOT_Syndicate Uniform|r (Master of Disguise hands it to you at the footlocker) to pass as one of them; stealth or suspicious acts can break it. If the footlocker gave you no uniform, Anastasia hands you one with Ain't No Telling. |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Anastasia Miller|r is not inside the keep: she stands on a ledge on the outside of the castle wall. Jump across to it from the roof of the house beside the ledge." },
        { "goto", x = 26.8, y = 64.4, zone = "1417" },
        { "turnin", quest = 96784, text = "Turn in Master of Disguise" },
        { "target", name = "Anastasia Miller" },
        { "goto", x = 26.8, y = 64.4, zone = "1417" },
        { "accept", quest = 96785, text = "Accept Ain't No Telling (Ain't No Telling)" },
        { "target", name = "Anastasia Miller" },
      },
      { only = "Rogue", source = "polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt",
        { "text", text = "Ain't No Telling" },
        { "text", text = "She will not talk without something to bargain with. Her stash is upstairs in a house close to the keep: take the |cOXP_LOOT_Stolen Funds|r. If it is already open, wait for it to come back." },
        { "goto", x = 29.5, y = 65.1, zone = "1417" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 96785, text = "Stolen Funds: 1 (|cOXP_LOOT_Stolen Funds|r: Anastasia's Stash)" },
        { "goto", x = 26.8, y = 64.4, zone = "1417" },
        { "turnin", quest = 96785, text = "Turn in Ain't No Telling" },
        { "target", name = "Anastasia Miller" },
        { "goto", x = 26.8, y = 64.4, zone = "1417" },
        { "accept", quest = 96786, text = "Accept The Syndicate Sting (The Syndicate Sting)" },
        { "target", name = "Anastasia Miller" },
      },
      { only = "Rogue", source = "polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt",
        { "text", text = "The Syndicate Sting" },
        { "text", text = "Falconcrest's men make the handoff at the southern end of Thoradin's Wall, the old wall between Arathi and Hillsbrad. Kill the two guarding the box and take the |cOXP_LOOT_Intercepted Shipment|r. Keep the |cOXP_LOOT_Syndicate Uniform|r: |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Myrokos Silentform|r wants it back with the shipment." },
        { "goto", x = 15.5, y = 43, zone = "1417" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 96786, text = "Intercepted Shipment: 1" },
      },
      { only = "Rogue", source = "polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt",
        { "text", text = "Back to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Myrokos Silentform|r" },
        { "goto", x = 84.93, y = 80.38, zone = "1416" },
        { "turnin", quest = 96786, text = "Turn in The Syndicate Sting (|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Myrokos Silentform|r: 70 silver, 300 |cOXP_ENEMY_Ravenholdt|r reputation)" },
        { "target", name = "Myrokos Silentform" },
      },
