        { "text", text = "The Tower of Ilgalar" },
        { "text", text = "Head east through Elwynn Forest into Redridge, or fly to Lakeshire. The Tower of Ilgalar stands alone in the east of the zone. Climb to the very top floor (not the one below): the treatise is the book sticking out of the shelf where the stairs come up. Two gnoll dogs and a gnoll caster guard the shelf; the dogs' Mana Burn interrupts the click, so fight them on the stairs out of their sight. Morganth (level 26 elite) stands across the top floor: you do not need him, keep to the left edge of the ramp so he stays put. The book is back two seconds after anyone takes it. If you die, your ghost can run up and come back to life beside it." },
